00:56:55.294 --> 00:56:57.181
Hey! Hey!


00:56:58.973 --> 00:57:01.419
Stop! Stop!


00:57:01.573 --> 00:57:03.063
They have to stop!


00:57:03.213 --> 00:57:04.419
It's not stopping!


00:57:13.614 --> 00:57:14.775
Check his pockets.


00:57:16.534 --> 00:57:19.014
He's alive.


00:57:23.294 --> 00:57:25.184
This is useful.


00:57:26.335 --> 00:57:28.143
And this.


00:57:30.054 --> 00:57:32.022
And this.


00:57:41.175 --> 00:57:43.064
Where are the girls?


00:57:44.295 --> 00:57:45.740
I don't speak Spanish.


00:57:49.935 --> 00:57:51.779
Marito, translate for me.


00:57:54.336 --> 00:57:56.337
Girls? Where?


00:58:00.455 --> 00:58:04.302
They're getting a doctor... for me.


00:58:04.496 --> 00:58:07.067
- A doctor...
- I don't believe him.


00:58:08.456 --> 00:58:10.424
L-He's lying-


00:58:28.735 --> 00:58:30.898
Where are the girls?


00:58:31.056 --> 00:58:34.139
Help me, please, help me!


00:58:35.216 --> 00:58:36.342
Oh, my God...


00:58:41.456 --> 00:58:44.745
Please, help me get out of here.


00:58:45.297 --> 00:58:48.665
Break the wood.


00:58:54.737 --> 00:58:57.217
My partner is already dead.


00:58:58.497 --> 00:59:00.898
Break the wood
and get me out of here.


00:59:01.057 --> 00:59:03.185
I know you can do it.


00:59:06.297 --> 00:59:07.537
Oh! Please...


00:59:08.617 --> 00:59:10.187
Come here.


00:59:13.578 --> 00:59:16.184
Last chance, Gringo.


00:59:16.338 --> 00:59:18.022
Where are the girls?


00:59:18.178 --> 00:59:23.788
They're not here. They went for a
doctor. They're getting me a doctor.


00:59:23.939 --> 00:59:24.939
They're getting me a doctor.


00:59:26.578 --> 00:59:28.262
They're not here.
They're getting me a doctor.


00:59:33.378 --> 00:59:35.824
He doesn't want to talk.


00:59:40.458 --> 00:59:42.301
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!


00:59:43.458 --> 00:59:44.459
Please don't! Don't!


00:59:48.498 --> 00:59:50.547
Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop!


01:00:00.738 --> 01:00:03.390
Where are they?


01:00:04.779 --> 01:00:07.544
I have a daughter! I have a daughter,
please! I have a daughter!


01:00:07.699 --> 01:00:09.428
He says he's got a daughter.


01:00:09.619 --> 01:00:11.826
Tell him she's about
to become an orphan.


01:00:12.219 --> 01:00:13.220
Shh!


01:00:41.660 --> 01:00:43.026
Use this.


01:00:45.821 --> 01:00:48.108
Use this to break the wood.


01:00:48.261 --> 01:00:51.504
We can call an ambulance.
I'm not going to kill him.


01:00:52.381 --> 01:00:56.545
Would you rather kill
two people than save one?


01:00:57.261 --> 01:01:01.390
I have a family.
Take the axe.


01:01:30.341 --> 01:01:32.343
Do it now! He's dead!


01:01:47.742 --> 01:01:49.632
Your friends. Where?


01:01:51.063 --> 01:01:54.544
Not here!


01:01:54.702 --> 01:01:56.192
Check if there are more
girls hiding around.


01:01:56.342 --> 01:01:57.832
No! No! No!


01:02:06.583 --> 01:02:07.869
There is nobody here.


01:02:08.023 --> 01:02:10.025
Leave us alone.


01:02:22.782 --> 01:02:24.546
No!


01:02:24.702 --> 01:02:25.703
Turn around!


01:02:25.862 --> 01:02:27.432
No! Stop!


01:02:29.703 --> 01:02:31.865
Shut up or I'll burn you alive!


01:02:35.423 --> 01:02:37.630
Thank you, dear God!


01:02:40.143 --> 01:02:45.105
- What is he saying?
- Prison... collapse.


01:02:46.304 --> 01:02:49.114
Prisoners are everywhere.


01:02:49.264 --> 01:02:51.504
They tried to steal the...


01:02:51.703 --> 01:02:52.909
- Fire truck?
- Yes.


01:02:53.063 --> 01:02:54.713
Oh, God, Kylie!
You got to help us!


01:03:24.505 --> 01:03:26.633
You are going to hell, motherfucker!


01:03:47.625 --> 01:03:49.037
There was another girl!


01:03:49.225 --> 01:03:50.989
Go get her!


01:03:51.185 --> 01:03:52.994
Besides you, Marito.


01:03:53.185 --> 01:03:55.153
Happy birthday, brother.


01:03:55.305 --> 01:03:57.387
Enjoy.


01:04:00.225 --> 01:04:02.433
No! No! No!


01:04:18.187 --> 01:04:19.597
Kylie!


01:04:23.866 --> 01:04:24.867
How's Gringo?


01:04:26.626 --> 01:04:29.358
They burned him alive!


01:04:29.507 --> 01:04:31.874
Irina! Irina, they have her!


01:04:32.027 --> 01:04:34.712
We have to save her!
We have to go!


01:04:51.067 --> 01:04:52.398
Oh, my God.


01:04:55.788 --> 01:04:57.756
We got to do something.


01:04:58.748 --> 01:05:00.875
No, it's too dangerous.


01:05:01.027 --> 01:05:03.348
She's right.
It's very dangerous. Let's go.


01:05:08.388 --> 01:05:09.799
I'm sick of this shit.


01:05:50.989 --> 01:05:53.356
Marito. Marito.


01:05:58.229 --> 01:05:59.310
Marito.


01:06:08.950 --> 01:06:10.714
- Irina!
- Let's go! Let's go!


01:06:10.910 --> 01:06:14.677
They killed, Marito!


01:06:24.389 --> 01:06:25.515
Follow me!


01:06:28.910 --> 01:06:30.878
Follow me!


01:06:47.470 --> 01:06:50.758
- Stay right there.
- Please, open the door!


01:06:50.950 --> 01:06:53.477
Step away from the gate!
Residents only!


01:06:53.631 --> 01:06:58.000
- Please, We need your help!
- We already have our share of troubles.


01:06:58.151 --> 01:07:00.199
Three of our friends are dead!


01:07:00.351 --> 01:07:01.637
Get out of here!


01:07:01.791 --> 01:07:04.237
Motherfucker! Let's go!


01:07:04.391 --> 01:07:05.677
Wait.


01:07:05.831 --> 01:07:08.722
- What are you doing?
- They can stay in my house.


01:07:08.872 --> 01:07:12.274
We can't just let anyone in.
They could be prisoners!


01:07:12.472 --> 01:07:14.998
It happened to the people just down
the street, they raped three women.


01:07:15.151 --> 01:07:20.283
We are not criminals.
I'm a fireman.


01:07:20.432 --> 01:07:22.514
Those rapists said the same thing.


01:07:22.672 --> 01:07:27.394
We're not prisoners.
We don't have tattoos.


01:07:27.552 --> 01:07:30.920
Look at me,
I don't have any tattoos!


01:07:31.072 --> 01:07:33.519
That's what a prisoner would say.


01:07:33.673 --> 01:07:36.836
I'm not risking my family.
I'm a single mother!


01:07:36.993 --> 01:07:41.794
Nobody is gonna harm my children.


01:07:41.952 --> 01:07:43.283
Get out now!


01:07:43.432 --> 01:07:47.357
You don't own the street, Mrs. Martinez!


01:07:47.552 --> 01:07:52.592
No one is going to tell me
what I can do!


01:07:52.752 --> 01:07:56.473
I'm tired of your paranoia!


01:07:57.112 --> 01:07:58.523
Come in.


01:07:59.713 --> 01:08:02.080
- Close the gate.
- Put down that gun.


01:08:03.273 --> 01:08:04.718
Come in.


01:08:04.873 --> 01:08:07.274
If you come in, I'll kill you!


01:08:13.514 --> 01:08:15.117
What did you do?


01:08:23.873 --> 01:08:27.401
- We have to go faster! Hurry up!
- We can't go any faster!


01:08:27.594 --> 01:08:31.485
- They're gonna catch us!
- Yes, yes. Yes, she is right.


01:08:31.634 --> 01:08:33.636
We're too slow. Wait here.


01:08:38.114 --> 01:08:42.916
OK, come. Come.
Come. Now! Now! Come!


01:08:43.075 --> 01:08:45.600
We hide him and find help.


01:08:48.434 --> 01:08:51.358
- We'll be back when it's safe.
- Please don't leave me.


01:08:55.675 --> 01:08:56.881
Shh...


01:08:57.035 --> 01:08:58.196
Shut up.


01:08:58.355 --> 01:09:00.926
We will come back for you.


01:09:01.075 --> 01:09:02.440
Don't make any noise.


01:09:03.274 --> 01:09:04.924
No! Kylie!


01:09:06.555 --> 01:09:08.683
Pollo, we're coming back
for you, I promise!


01:09:08.835 --> 01:09:10.246
Go! Go!


01:09:37.396 --> 01:09:44.483
<i>Son... where are you?
I can't hear you.</i>


01:09:44.995 --> 01:09:49.877
Dad, I'm in Valparaiso.
You need to come for us.


01:09:50.036 --> 01:09:51.447
Fuck.


01:10:16.197 --> 01:10:19.406
Say hello to my brother, motherfucker.


01:10:48.877 --> 01:10:50.447
Father, open the door.


01:10:51.278 --> 01:10:52.723
Get away, please.


01:10:52.878 --> 01:10:56.007
Father, you know me.
I'm Ramon.


01:10:56.158 --> 01:10:58.889
You baptized me.


01:11:00.238 --> 01:11:04.403
We're just trying to stop
the gringos that murdered Marito.


01:11:04.559 --> 01:11:08.359
It was self defense.


01:11:08.759 --> 01:11:12.444
Father, please open the door,
we're not gonna harm you.


01:11:12.998 --> 01:11:17.162
We just wanna turn them
over to the justice.


01:11:17.318 --> 01:11:19.720
Please, don't do it.
They want to kill us.


01:11:20.439 --> 01:11:22.806
Open the fucking door!


01:12:23.640 --> 01:12:24.722
Do you think they're dead?


01:12:25.881 --> 01:12:26.962
Shh...


01:12:29.841 --> 01:12:30.842
Nothing.


01:12:32.401 --> 01:12:35.166
Follow me.


01:12:38.162 --> 01:12:39.925
What is he saying?


01:12:40.081 --> 01:12:41.970
The... the tunnel... The exit.


01:12:42.121 --> 01:12:44.010
No, no. Can't we just wait here?


01:12:44.161 --> 01:12:45.731
I'm not going to wait
for another aftershock!


01:12:47.801 --> 01:12:49.803
- Is this going to hold us?
- Wait.


01:12:50.482 --> 01:12:51.893
I go first.


01:13:11.521 --> 01:13:13.285
It's OK!


01:13:14.401 --> 01:13:15.846
Come on!


01:13:18.362 --> 01:13:21.013
I'm gonna check the tunnel.


01:13:23.122 --> 01:13:24.931
No, no, no. Go.


01:13:49.203 --> 01:13:52.366
My leg! My leg!


01:13:52.523 --> 01:13:55.003
- My leg! My leg!
- Kylie!


01:13:57.484 --> 01:14:00.374
- Kylie!
- My leg! Something stuck!


01:14:00.524 --> 01:14:02.128
Fucking something
sticking out of me!


01:14:02.284 --> 01:14:04.491
- He's dead.
- Help!


01:14:06.324 --> 01:14:09.054
We need to take it out.


01:14:12.764 --> 01:14:15.370
I need to see, OK? I need to see.


01:14:20.884 --> 01:14:22.727
- Stop! Stop! Stop!
- OK!


01:14:24.485 --> 01:14:27.647
I can't walk! I can't walk!


01:14:29.564 --> 01:14:31.566
Look at me,
I will count to three.


01:14:34.244 --> 01:14:38.613
Shh... One.


01:14:38.804 --> 01:14:40.533
Two.


01:14:42.644 --> 01:14:44.089
Three!


01:14:46.084 --> 01:14:48.530
I took it out! She's OK!


01:14:48.684 --> 01:14:51.495
You need to come down here, OK?


01:14:51.645 --> 01:14:56.128
Yeah, yeah. I'm coming down.
I'm taking you out of there, OK?


01:14:56.325 --> 01:14:59.056
Please don't go, I need you!


01:14:59.245 --> 01:15:01.976
I need you too!


01:15:02.165 --> 01:15:03.497
I'm coming down.


01:15:10.325 --> 01:15:13.135
Lay down, lay down. Lay down.


01:15:13.285 --> 01:15:15.253
Wait, wait, wait...


01:15:22.926 --> 01:15:27.011
Lay down here.
Take it. Take it.


01:15:45.967 --> 01:15:49.129
I won't say anything, I promise.


01:15:49.286 --> 01:15:53.894
Please... I won't say anything,
I really won't...


01:16:52.129 --> 01:16:53.210
Kylie!


01:16:59.009 --> 01:17:00.295
Kylie!


01:17:20.569 --> 01:17:21.900
Kylie!


01:17:47.730 --> 01:17:50.700
I promise she didn't suffer.

